医生的一根金手指  就能破"门"而入
I know it only takes one doctor's finger.

360
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:29,420
你好
Hello.

361
00:16:29,420 --> 00:16:30,770
你好
Hello.

362
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,790
我们走  你们慢谈
We should let you guys talk.

363
00:16:32,790 --> 00:16:34,010
对
Yeah.

364
00:16:34,010 --> 00:16:35,060
你们不用离开
You don't have to leave.

365
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:36,700
瞧我飞速飘走
Look at me go!

366
00:16:38,810 --> 00:16:40,190
伯纳黛特  你还要开车送我呢
Uh, Bernadette, you're my ride.

367
00:16:40,190 --> 00:16:41,660
自己走路
Walk!

368
00:16:46,750 --> 00:16:48,140
你最近好吗
How have you been?

369
00:16:48,410 --> 00:16:49,960
最近还行
I'm doing all right.

370
00:16:50,620 --> 00:16:52,500
我今天练击剑了
I tried fencing today.

371
00:16:53,100 --> 00:16:54,340
顺利吗
How'd that go?

372
00:16:54,340 --> 00:16:55,880
挺简单的
It was pretty easy.

373
00:16:56,760 --> 00:17:00,150
应该是我"数学竞技"的背景有所助益
And I think my background in "mathletics" helped.

374
00:17:01,550 --> 00:17:03,290
巴里·克瑞普吉也在
Barry Kripke was there.

375
00:17:03,290 --> 00:17:04,380
我应该告诉你
I should let you know

376
00:17:04,380 --> 00:17:07,680
他对你感兴趣想约你出去
that he expressed interest in asking you out.

377
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:11,090
其实他已经约了
Well, actually, he-he already did.

378
00:17:11,090 --> 00:17:12,400
好吧
Okay.

379
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:14,130
但别陷太深
But don't get too attached to him.

380
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:17,640
再过2年又364天  他就死翘翘了
In two years, 364 days, he's a dead man.

381
00:17:20,490 --> 00:17:22,150
我拒绝了
I said no.

382
00:17:22,510 --> 00:17:23,480
有意思
Interesting.

383
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:26,920
我今天约了两个女人  都拒绝我了
I asked two women out today, and they both said no.

384
00:17:28,540 --> 00:17:31,390
我不知道你想跟人约会呢
I didn't know you were interested in dating.

385
00:17:31,390 --> 00:17:34,070
听说这有助于走出失恋阴霾
I've been told it's a good way to move on.

386
00:17:37,190 --> 00:17:38,860
这样啊
Okay.

387
00:17:42,130 --> 00:17:44,940
总之  很高兴再见到你
Anyway, um, it's nice to see you.

388
00:17:44,940 --> 00:17:46,200
你看起来不错
You look good.

389
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,300
谢谢
Mmm, thanks.

390
00:17:47,300 --> 00:17:49,520
我尝起来还很美味哦
And I taste good too.

391
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,160
华仔
Howie?

392
00:18:00,480 --> 00:18:01,150
怎么了
What's up?

393
00:18:02,630 --> 00:18:07,370
你的运动手环怎么显示昨天你跑了280公里
Why does your Fitbit say you ran 174 miles yesterday?

